{%- doc -%}
  A row of inline policy links (e.g. "Privacy policy · Terms of service"), one per shop policy set
  under Settings > Policies.

  @param {object} [settings] - Block settings: variant, size (see blocks/mionas-link.liquid)
  @param {string} [shopify_attributes] - block.shopify_attributes, for editor selection

  @example
  {% render 'mionas-policy-links', settings: block.settings, shopify_attributes: block.shopify_attributes %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Fork of blocks/footer-policy-list.liquid: that native block hides the policies behind a
  popover trigger button, which is the "menu" this is inlining. shop.policies is looped directly
  here for the same reason as mionas-language-links -- the set of policies is store-configured,
  not merchant-placed blocks, so a mionas-group of hand-added links would drift out of sync.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if shop.policies.size > 0 %}
  <ul class="mionas-policy-links list-unstyled" role="list" {{ shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- for policy in shop.policies -%}
      {%- if policy != blank -%}
        {%- assign policy_title = policy.title | escape -%}
        <li>
          {% render 'mionas-link',
            content: policy_title,
            link: policy.url,
            variant: settings.variant,
            size: settings.size
          %}
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
{% endif %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .mionas-policy-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs, 8px) var(--space-sm, 16px);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Matches .mionas-language-links .mionas-link's override in snippets/mionas-language-links.liquid
     -- mionas-link's sm/md tokens (15-16px) are sized for body links, too large next to the 12px
     footer-copyright text this row sits beside. */
  .mionas-policy-links .mionas-link {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
